  "notes": "File naming YYqN uses Sony's fiscal-year label (26q1 = 2026年度 第1四半期 = 2027年3月期 第1四半期). Q2 FY2027 not yet published. Presentation = 決算説明会資料 (for Q4: 説明会資料（業績）; management-policy speech decks not used). For 2025年度 第1四半期 Sony also posted a separate Sony Financial Group deck (25q1_sonyfgpre.pdf), not used. sony.com sits behind Akamai bot protection: curl -sIL returns 403 for every PDF (the in-app browser also refuses sony.com), so links were verified with a Node fetch using browser headers (200, application/pdf, %PDF header) and the cover text was checked."
